abstract: >-
  A general conceptual ontology for organizing ecosystem and enterprise risk
  knowledge. Package v0.3.10 selects scientific model/native/OWL 0.3.2,
  documentary review 0.2.0, explicit-data task profile 0.1.0 and reader 0.4.10, with source-bound
  engineering qualification and separately scoped historical evidence.
